MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_001: Heh! My tab's gonna get pretty crazy if the war\nkeeps dragging on.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_002: BUT, with all these battles to fight, there's plenty\nof coin to be made, I suppose.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_003: Hey, now, don't be jealous. I promise to bring back\nplenty of stories to keep you entertained.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_004: <NCA>"Simon? Who are you talking to?"
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_005: Oh, er—Promised One... Just the ramblings of a\ndrunk, that's all.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_006: <NCA>"There are two cups..."
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_007: <NCB>"You don't seem drunk to me."
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_008: <ACA>Oh, right. It's not like it's a secret, but it's also not\nTHAT interesting a story...
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_009: <ACB>Yeah, you got me. You never know when an enemy'll\npop up, so it's best to keep your wits about you.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_010: This cup's for an old war buddy who passed away.\nWe were close...which is a bit rare for me.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_011: Heh, and no, I don't mean Talimun. That\nguy was just a...special customer.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_012: An arrogant one too. Always goin' on about being a\ndemigod, just to die before a mere human like me...
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_013: Some days, when the mood is right, I like to drink\nto remember my friend.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_014: I'm grateful, ya know? Brimstone Lords and undead\nkeep showing up, but I haven't run into him yet.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_015: I can only hope that wherever he is, the man's\nfound some peace.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_016: Maybe it's 'cause I've been pouring him drinks all\nthis time... Maybe he's just glad to be out of the fight.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_017: Going already? I thought you'd have more questions.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_018: What kinda guy he was, how he died? I mean, c'mon,\nthere's even an empty seat here.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_019: <NCA>"I don't think that's what you really want."
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_020: <NCB>"The seat seems occupied to me..."
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_021: <ACA>Hmph. You know me better than I thought.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_022: <ACB>Hmph. That's kind of you, having such consideration\nfor a friend of a friend.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_023: Hey, I'm curious. What's your favorite drink? Or...do\npromised ones even drink at all?
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_024: <NCA>"I'm trying too hard not to die."
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_A_025: Then we're a match made in the underworld, my\nfriend. I'll see you on the field.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_001: Damn. The weather's almost nice enough to piss me\noff... I bet you're resting easy though.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_002: Here, let me pour you one. Not sure if you'll like it,\nbut I guess it's the thought that counts, huh...
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_003: <NCA>"Depends on who you ask."
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_004: What the— Promised One! How the hell are you\nhere? I was sure...
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_005: <NCA>"Thought I'd die so easily, huh?"
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_006: <NCB>"Sorry to worry you."
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_007: <ACA>Heh. Next time, I'll do the evaporating, and see\nif you don't think the same!
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_008: <ACB>Worried? Heh...nah. I only worry about someone if\nI think there's a chance I'll see them again...
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_009: Damn, and you're positively glowing too.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_010: I'm so glad you're safe. Well done getting back.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_011: I thought I was used to losing people. But when I\nthought you died... Well, it hit me pretty hard.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_012: I knew we wouldn't be able to save everyone. And...\nI know death comes for all of us in the end.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_013: But I never doubted you'd be the one to save\nus all.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_014: I've watched so many people die who said they\nwouldn't. But you were different. I...believed you.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_015: And then you went and left us... And I wished I\nhad stopped you.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_016: I know it's an odd thing to say, but I never thought\nI'd feel as much hope as I do when it comes to you.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_017: <NCA>"Thank you for believing in me, Simon."
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_018: Oh, stop. Telling me all about what happened will\nbe thanks enough.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_019: While I was pouring our drinks, I realized I still don't\nknow which ones you like.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_020: So, let me have it. What flavors does the Promised\nOne prefer?
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_021: <RSDS>To be honest...I'm not sure where to go from here.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_022: The war, the fighting... They were the only things\nthat gave me purpose...
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_023: So when you saved the world, it gave everyone\npeace except for me.
MID_SE_Ism_Sim_S_024: Maybe it's time you be MY peace now. What do\nyou say, Promised One?